codex
The installed toolchain is complete under `/opt/elan`, but the proxy was searching the default per-user location because `ELAN_HOME` was unset. I’m rerunning the unchanged preflight with `ELAN_HOME=/opt/elan`, which points the launcher to the pinned Lean 4.22.0 installation without altering any input.
