+1. `rule-031285...` maps to the `Int` cast-is-defined equivalence.
+2. `rule-0dda33...` maps to the `Str` cast-is-defined equivalence.
+3. `rule-532e0f...` maps to guarded `str` dispatch through `Int2String` and
